WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.640
In Hindu thought, there is a day
that lasts 4.32 billion years.

2
00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:08.740
At its dawn, the universe comes forth.

3
00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.790
At its night, everything is dissolved.

4
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.130
Then a new dawn, and it all begins again.

5
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.250
Time is a wheel, not a straight line.

6
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.080
So if the universe is made, kept
and destroyed again and again,

7
00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.610
who does each job?

8
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.510
And is it one God?

9
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.290
In this mission, you'll meet the Trimurti,

10
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.810
linked to creating,
preserving and destroying.

11
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.510
Then you'll find out
why the creator, Brahma,

12
00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.040
has very few temples today.

13
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:42.990
Your mission: find out who makes,
keeps and destroys the universe,

14
00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.830
and whether it is one God.
